But crucially – note what happens immediately *before* any discussion begins?

From previous timestamp segment ([DAY1 11:12:30–11:12:59]) → You're seen interacting physically w/microphone + boxes/paper items being passed between people—including return of something belonging to Alice (“returned Alice’s paper box”). This indicates active involvement early-on-with-Alice-related-items-but-not-direct-reference-yet-toward-scissors-per-se-until-later-timepoint…

